      "Body 3: analyses the RBA's dilemma (hold rates restrictive for longer and risk a downturn vs accept above-target inflation and lose credibility; over-tightening risk; wage-price feedback)",
      "Conclusion: synthesises to 'sticky prices make the last mile hard and prolong tight policy' and links to the thesis",
